1. Install Node 22 and enable pnpm with `corepack enable`, then run `pnpm install`.
2. `pnpm test` runs the unit and scenario suites; `pnpm build` compiles `src/` to `dist/`.
<% if (it.spec.platform === 'cli') { -%>
3. `node dist/bin.js --help` runs the built CLI (`pnpm build` first).
<% } else { -%>
3. Import the public API from the package entry point (`src/index.ts`).
<% } -%>
